  "description": "The C# Uplink surface for Gonogo, a mission-control dashboard for Kerbal Space Program: the attributes, descriptors and payload types a KSP mod implements to publish telemetry to a Gonogo host, and the contract version stamp the host loads it against. Its C# namespace is `Sitrep.Contract`. The TypeScript half of the same contract is the npm package `@ksp-gonogo/sitrep-sdk`.",
